## 6. 🔌 DAO Architecture Workflow

The DAO pattern provides a separate layer for database access operations.

```text
Application Classes
       |
       v
Business / Application Logic
       |
       v
DAO Interface or DAO Class Methods
       |
       +-------------------------------+
       |         |          |          |
       v         v          v          v
   AdminDAO  MenuItemDAO  OrderDAO   BillDAO
       |         |          |          |
       +---------+----------+----------+
                         |
                         v
                  DBConnecton.java
                         |
                         v
                     JDBC Driver
                         |
                         v
                   MySQL Database
                         |
                         v
                Query Results / Status
                         |
                         v
                  Calling Application
```

### DAO Responsibilities

| Class | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `AdminDAO` | Administrator authentication queries |
| `MenuCategoryDAO` | Menu category database operations |
| `MenuItemDAO` | Menu item CRUD and search operations |
| `OrderDAO` | Order persistence and related stock operations |
| `BillDAO` | Bill creation and retrieval |
| `DBConnecton` | Establishes the JDBC connection to MySQL |

